html=r'''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#07110d"><meta name="description" content="Explore the live 2026 U.S. voting map, anonymous Voted/Not Yet check-ins, state and district totals, official voting resources, activity timeline, and private voting-plan tools."><meta name="robots" content="index,follow,max-image-preview:large,max-snippet:-1"><link rel="canonical" href="https://letsgovotethistime.com/voting-map"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Let's Go Vote This Time"><meta property="og:title" content="2026 Voting Map — Live Check-Ins, State Intel & Official Voting Info"><meta property="og:description" content="Use the live map, state intelligence panel, privacy-safe activity timeline, official voting resources, and private voting plan."><meta property="og:url" content="https://letsgovotethistime.com/voting-map"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary"><title>2026 Voting Map — Live Check-Ins & Official Voting Info</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/map-enhancements.css"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Dataset","name":"2026 Anonymous Voting Check-In Map","url":"https://letsgovotethistime.com/voting-map","description":"Privacy-thresholded aggregate anonymous self-reported voting check-ins. Not official turnout.","spatialCoverage":{"@type":"Country","name":"United States"},"isAccessibleForFree":true}</script></head><body class="map-page"><div class="election-day-banner" id="electionDayBanner">ELECTION DAY MODE — VERIFY YOUR LOCATION · GET HELP · PLAN A BACKUP RIDE · VOTE</div><div class="topline"><span class="pulse"></span>LIVE ANONYMOUS CHECK-INS · OFFICIAL VOTING INFO KEPT SEPARATE</div><header class="nav map-shell"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">V</span><span>LET'S GO VOTE <strong>THIS TIME</strong></span></a><nav><a href="/check-in">Check in</a><a href="/register">Register</a><a href="/rides-to-polls">Ride guide</a><a href="/voter-help">Voter help</a></nav></header><main class="map-shell"><section class="map-hero"><div class="eyebrow green">THE 2026 VOTING MAP</div><h1>LIGHT UP<br>THE COUNTRY.</h1><p>Anonymous self-reported check-ins show where people have told us <strong>Voted</strong> or <strong>Not Yet</strong>. Select a state for current state intelligence, district totals, official voting actions, transportation resources, and a privacy-safe activity timeline. Self-reports are never presented as official turnout.</p><div class="freshness-bar"><strong id="freshnessLabel">LIVE DATA</strong><span id="freshnessTime">Loading latest aggregate…</span><button class="utility-control" id="highContrast" type="button">HIGH CONTRAST</button></div><div class="map-stats"><div class="map-stat"><strong id="mapTotal">—</strong><span>CHECK-INS</span></div><div class="map-stat"><strong id="mapVoted">—</strong><span>VOTED</span></div><div class="map-stat"><strong id="mapNotYet">—</strong><span>NOT YET</span></div></div><div class="map-controls" role="group" aria-label="Map layer"><button class="map-control active" data-layer="all">ALL CHECK-INS</button><button class="map-control" data-layer="voted">VOTED</button><button class="map-control" data-layer="not_yet">NOT YET</button></div><div class="mobile-state-picker"><label for="mobileStateSelect">JUMP TO A STATE</label><select id="mobileStateSelect" aria-label="Jump to a state"></select></div><div class="legend"><span><i class="dot"></i> Voted check-ins</span><span><i class="dot white"></i> Not Yet check-ins</span></div></section><section class="map-layout"><div class="map-stage" id="mapStage"><svg id="usMap" viewBox="0 0 975 610" role="img" aria-label="Interactive United States voting check-in map"></svg><div class="map-note">Keyboard: Tab to a state and press Enter or Space. Exact polling places remain separate and will appear only from a verified official feed.</div></div><aside class="map-panel" id="statePanel"><div class="eyebrow green">STATE INTELLIGENCE</div><h2 id="panelTitle">UNITED STATES</h2><div class="panel-stat"><span>Check-ins</span><strong id="panelTotal">—</strong></div><div class="panel-stat"><span>Voted</span><strong id="panelVoted">—</strong></div><div class="panel-stat"><span>Not Yet</span><strong id="panelNotYet">—</strong></div><div class="panel-stat"><span>Voted share of check-ins</span><strong id="panelPct">—</strong></div><div class="state-intel"><div class="intel-grid"><div class="intel-card"><strong>DISPLAY THRESHOLD</strong><span id="thresholdStatus">Privacy-safe aggregate view</span></div><div class="intel-card"><strong>OFFICIAL INFO</strong><span id="officialVerified">Primary election sources linked</span></div><div class="intel-card"><strong>TRANSPORT</strong><span>Self-service Uber, Lyft, transit, paratransit and local resources</span></div><div class="intel-card"><strong>POLLING PINS</strong><span id="pollingPinStatus">Waiting for verified official feed</span></div></div></div><div id="districtBreakdown"></div><div class="official-box"><div class="smallcaps">OFFICIAL VOTING ACTIONS</div><p>Polling places can change. Verify your address-specific location, registration status, deadlines, early/mail voting options, and local election-office information through official sources.</p><div class="official-actions"><a class="button primary wide" id="officialTool" href="https://official.votinginfotool.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FIND WHERE I VOTE ↗</a><a class="button ghost" id="stateOfficial" href="https://www.eac.gov/vote" target="_blank" rel="noopener">STATE GUIDE ↗</a><a class="button ghost" id="registrationTool" href="https://vote.gov/register" target="_blank" rel="noopener">REGISTER / CHECK ↗</a><a class="button ghost" id="rideTool" href="/rides-to-polls">PLAN A RIDE →</a><a class="button ghost" id="helpTool" href="/voter-help">VOTER HELP →</a><a class="button ghost" id="statePageTool" href="/voting-map">STATE RESOURCE PAGE →</a></div><div class="share-grid"><button class="share-state" id="shareState" type="button">SHARE STATE LINK ↗</button><button class="share-state" id="shareCard" type="button">SHARE STATE CARD ↗</button></div><div class="source-status"><strong id="sourceVerified">OFFICIAL-SOURCE LINKS VERIFIED SEPTEMBER 9, 2026.</strong><br>Official resources and anonymous self-reports are kept separate.</div></div></aside></section><section class="timeline-section"><div class="timeline-head"><div><div class="eyebrow green">ACTIVITY OVER TIME</div><h2 id="timelineTitle">NATIONAL CHECK-IN ACTIVITY</h2></div><p>Hourly activity shows when anonymous check-ins were added and when participants marked <strong>Voted</strong>. It is not official turnout, polling, or a measure of eligible voters.</p></div><svg id="timelineChart" class="timeline-chart" role="img" aria-label="Hourly anonymous voting check-in activity"></svg><div class="timeline-legend">Green = new anonymous check-ins · White = check-ins marked Voted · most recent 7 days available</div></section><section class="plan-section"><div class="plan-head"><div><div class="eyebrow green">PRIVATE VOTING PLAN</div><h2>SAVE IT ON THIS DEVICE.</h2></div><p>Your polling-place address, transportation choice and voting time stay in this browser's local storage. They are not sent to Let's Go Vote This Time.</p></div><div class="plan-form"><input id="planLocation" placeholder="Official polling-place address"><select id="planTransport"><option value="">Transportation</option><option>Uber</option><option>Lyft</option><option>Public transit</option><option>Paratransit</option><option>Taxi</option><option>Drive</option><option>Walk</option><option>Ride from someone I trust</option></select><input id="planTime" type="datetime-local" aria-label="Planned voting time"></div><div class="plan-actions"><button class="utility-control active" id="savePlan" type="button">SAVE PRIVATE PLAN</button><button class="utility-control" id="clearPlan" type="button">CLEAR</button><a class="utility-control" id="openRoute" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OPEN ROUTE</a></div><div class="saved-status" id="planStatus"></div></section><section class="data-strip"><div><h3>SELF-REPORTED LAYER</h3><p>Voted / Not Yet comes from voluntary anonymous check-ins. State/district aggregates use privacy thresholds. No candidate, party or ballot-choice data is collected. <a href="/check-in-privacy">Privacy & duplicate controls ↗</a></p></div><div><h3>OFFICIAL INFORMATION LAYER</h3><p>Official actions route to trusted election sources. Exact polling-place pins remain disabled until supplied by a verified official provider feed. They will never be inferred from anonymous check-ins.</p></div></section></main><div class="mobile-checkin-bar"><strong>DID YOU VOTE?</strong><a href="/check-in">LIGHT UP THE MAP →</a></div><footer class="footer map-shell"><div><div class="brand footer-brand"><span class="brand-mark">V</span><span>LET'S GO VOTE <strong>THIS TIME</strong></span></div><p>Nonpartisan voter access. Self-reports and official election data stay separate.</p></div><div class="footer-links"><a href="/check-in">Add a check-in ↗</a><a href="/voter-help">Voter help ↗</a></div></footer><script src="/assets/d3.v7.min.js"></script><script src="/assets/topojson-client.min.js"></script><script src="/growth.js"></script><script src="/map-state-actions.js"></script><script src="/voting-map.js"></script></body></html>'''
